# Brook OS — nix-install gltron end-to-end.
# This is the BRO-192 repro workload: nix-fetch prefetches many narinfo(s) in
# one multithreaded curl and forks/mmaps heavily, which previously deadlocked
# the SMP TLB shootdown path. Used to confirm the fix holds under the real load.
run /nix/bin/nix-install gltron
